-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Throat_Punch\" title=\"Throat Punch\">Throat Punch</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hush_You!\" title=\"Hush You!\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Hush_You%21_Icon.webp/30px-Hush_You%21_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Hush_You%21_Icon.webp/45px-Hush_You%21_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Hush_You%21_Icon.webp/60px-Hush_You%21_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hush You!\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Hush_You%21_Icon.webp/30px-Hush_You%21_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Hush_You%21_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hush_You!\" title=\"Hush You!\">Hush You!</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>SILENCED</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Garrotted\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Garrotted_(Condition)\" title=\"Garrotted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Garrotted\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Garrotted_(Condition)\" title=\"Garrotted (Condition)\">Garrotted</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is being strangled by a garrotte. It is <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Silenced</a> and takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">3d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a> damage per turn.</li>\n<li>Both the entity and the garrotter can't move until the condition ends.</li>\n<li>If the entity and the garrotter are forcibly moved more than 5 m (17 ft) apart, this condition ends.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Silenced\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silenced\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Silenced</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Creature can't speak or cast spells with a verbal component, and is immune to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Singing\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Singing_(Condition)\" title=\"Singing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Singing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Singing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Singing_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Singing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Singing_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Singing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Singing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Singing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Singing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Singing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Singing_(Condition)\" title=\"Singing (Condition)\">Singing</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The harpy <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luring_Song_(Condition)\" title=\"Luring Song (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lures\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Luring_Song_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Luring_Song_(Condition)\" title=\"Luring Song (Condition)\">Lures</a> nearby creatures with a magical melody.</li>\n<li>The song ends if she is incapacitated or loses concentration.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715000536\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.143 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.153 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6903/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 127070/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 34457/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.086/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1350274/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  126.070      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%  126.070      1 -total\n 75.50%   95.189      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 63.57%   80.143      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 54.79%   69.079     14 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 24.70%   31.142      5 Template:MdRarityItem\n 23.66%   29.822     17 Template:Icon_link\n 22.57%   28.451     17 Template:Icon_text\n 22.02%   27.758     76 Template:Trim\n 21.27%   26.821      5 Template:Item_icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:5480-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715000536 and revision id 342971. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}